  m_Name: BagCheck
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::MarsSampling.DialogueSequence
  lines:
  - speaker: Good Luck (radio)
    text: 'Right: MS-01 through MS-10, one duplicate bag MS-10-B, and one oversize
      spare. Twelve. All numbered, all sealed.'
  - speaker: You
    text: Why do we number the bags and not the rocks?
  - speaker: Good Luck (radio)
    text: Because rocks don't hold ink and Big Boss doesn't hold briefings. Tablet's
      updated - Site 1 flag is out ahead. Orange. Hard to miss.
